# Feature 004 (story 3): the menu entry "Update all" is still there and starts the same run as the button: the combined confirmation, then the
# summary. Nothing is left to update afterwards, so neither the banner nor the menu entry is offered.
# scenario demo
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap menu
tap menuUpdateAll
waitfor updateAllIntro
expect_count updateAllEntry 1
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor resultText Updated:
expect resultText App app-02
tap ok
waitfor appRow
expect_absent updateBanner
tap menu
expect_absent menuUpdateAll
quit
